      "description": "Whether you’re exploring a zoo, theme park, botanical garden, historic district, university campus, festival, resort, or another BetterMaps destination, our latest release helps you spend less time looking at your phone and more time enjoying the experience around you.\nNew & Improved\nPlan Your Perfect Day\nCreate a personalized itinerary with My Plan. Save attractions, restaurants, events, and experiences before you arrive, then let BetterMaps help guide your day from start to finish.\nDiscover What’s Happening\nThe enhanced Event Calendar makes it easy to see today’s events, shows, tours, and activities so you never miss the experiences that matter most.\nFind Locations Faster\nQuickly search and browse attractions, dining, restrooms, shops, exhibits, parking, and more with an improved location experience designed to help you find exactly what you’re looking for.\nSmarter Walking Navigation\nGet clearer walking directions with estimated travel times, distances, and intuitive turn-by-turn guidance built specifically for places people explore—not roads people drive.\nEverything, Better\nWe’ve refreshed the entire experience with improved performance, a cleaner design, faster navigation, smoother interactions, and numerous enhancements throughout the app.\nDesigned for Discovery\nBetterMaps helps you experience more by bringing together navigation, events, attractions, dining, and personalized planning into one simple, intuitive app.\nLess searching.\n More discovering.\n More experiencing.\n\nBring BetterMaps to Your Destination\nEvery great destination deserves a great mobile experience.\nBetterMaps helps organizations create fully branded apps that inspire discovery, simplify navigation, strengthen visitor engagement, and create unforgettable experiences from arrival to departure.\nWhether you manage a park, zoo, university, resort, historic district, event, or cultural attraction, BetterMaps can help your visitors experience more—and help your organization achieve more.\nVisit BetterMaps.com to learn more.",
